@startuml sequence
participant "Користувач (браузер)" as User
participant "Client\n[JS/index.js]" as ClientIndex
participant "Client\n[JS/table.js]" as ClientTable
participant "Server\n[JS/server.js]" as Server
participant "Функції\n[JS/functions.js]" as Func
database "MySQL\n[JS/db.js]" as DB
note over ClientIndex, ClientTable: UI сторінки\n[index.html], [table.html]

== Завантаження списку таблиць ==
User -> ClientIndex: Відкриття сторінки
ClientIndex -> Server: GET /api/meta_tables?page=&limit=   [index.loadTables]
Server -> DB: SELECT ... FROM `meta_tables`
DB --> Server: rows / count
Server --> ClientIndex: JSON { data, totalPages, page } 
ClientIndex -> User: render list (loadTables)

== Імпорт Excel (.xlsx) ==
User -> ClientIndex: Клік "Імпорт" -> вибір файлу
ClientIndex -> Server: POST /upload (multipart/form-data)  [server.POST /upload]
Server -> Server: parse Excel (exceljs)
Server -> Func: detectColumnType(columnValues)  [functions.detectColumnType]
Func --> Server: column types
Server -> DB: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS `tableName` (...)
DB --> Server: OK
Server -> DB: INSERT INTO meta_tables (...)
DB --> Server: OK
Server -> DB: INSERT IGNORE INTO `tableName` (...) (дані)
DB --> Server: OK
Server --> ClientIndex: { message: "Таблиця ... оновлена" }
ClientIndex -> User: alert(message) + reload

== Відкриття таблиці ==
User -> ClientIndex: click row -> openTable(tableName)  [index.openTable]
ClientIndex -> User: redirect /table?tableName=...
User -> ClientTable: load table page
ClientTable -> Server: GET /api/table/:tableName  [table.loadTable]
Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM `tableName` LIMIT/OFFSET
DB --> Server: rows
Server --> ClientTable: JSON rows (форматування дат)
ClientTable -> User: render table

== Додавання / Редагування / Видалення рядка ==
User -> ClientTable: submit add form
ClientTable -> Server: POST /api/table/:tableName (body)  [server.POST /api/table/:tableName]
Server -> Func: generateRegistrationNumber(...) (якщо потрібно)  [functions.generateRegistrationNumber]
Func --> Server: newRegistrationNumber
Server -> DB: INSERT INTO `tableName` SET ?
DB --> Server: insertId
Server --> ClientTable: { id }
ClientTable -> ClientTable: loadTable() -> GET /api/table/:tableName

User -> ClientTable: edit row -> PUT /api/table/:tableName/:id
ClientTable -> Server: PUT /api/table/:tableName/:id  [server.PUT /api/table/:tableName/:id]
Server -> DB: UPDATE `tableName` SET ... WHERE id=?
DB --> Server: OK
Server --> ClientTable: success
ClientTable -> ClientTable: loadTable()

User -> ClientTable: delete row -> DELETE /api/table/:tableName/:id
ClientTable -> Server: DELETE /api/table/:tableName/:id  [server.DELETE /api/table/:tableName/:id]
Server -> DB: DELETE FROM `tableName` WHERE id=?
DB --> Server: OK
Server --> ClientTable: success
ClientTable -> ClientTable: loadTable()

== Експорт таблиці ==
User -> ClientTable: click Export
ClientTable -> Server: GET /api/table/:tableName/export  [table.exportTable]
Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM `tableName`
DB --> Server: rows
Server -> Server: ExcelJs -> workbook.xlsx.write(response)
Server --> ClientTable: xlsx stream
ClientTable -> User: початок завантаження файлу

@enduml
